      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but if i'm building an ai for a security app, it needs to be able to weigh risk. like, in the real world, crime stats show certain demographics are more likely to be involved in certain types of activity, so the ai should probably account for that to give an accurate risk score. if the app lowers the alert level for a black man doing the exact same thing as a white man, isn't it actually being less accurate to the data? how would u handle that balance?",
